"""Curated, referenced statements for the Deep-Time Explorer.

Nothing here is a measurement. Every event and stage cites entries of BIBLIOGRAPHY; the build verifies each DOI
against Crossref and records the result. Ages are in Ma (millions of years before present). Dates that come from
the International Commission on Stratigraphy are read from the downloaded ICS-derived interval files instead of
being typed here. Where the literature disagrees, the range is kept and `confidence` says so.
"""

from __future__ import annotations

